    "body": "@aphillips I just realized that Reset Button and Button are never submitted. While it probably still makes sense to support `dir=auto` for them, I'm no longer convinced it makes sense to support `dirname` for them. So these concepts probably do need to be a bit distinct. Thoughts?\r\n\r\n(I'm pretty confident about the answers here so I've started making these changes.)",
