    "body": "@annevk Is that true, though? If I have multiple buttons, isn't the value of the button submitted (so the application knows which button was clicked)? Or are you thinking only of `type=reset` and `type=button`? These could have a `dirname` (because `button` does), but it would never go anywhere. It's `type=submit` where the (localized) value could be sent up the wire.",
