    "body": "@aphillips right, `type=reset` and `type=button` are where `dir=auto` makes sense, but `dirname` does not.\r\n\r\nAlso, I did not include the `button` element for now, but I can see how it makes sense for `dirname`. (It does not make sense for being part of a special `dir=auto` category as it is a normal element with children.) I guess that's another change to make.",
